#. Overrides Django's German text (django/conf/locale/de), which contains a sharp s; shown
#. e.g. for negative values in positive integer fields.
#, python-format
msgid "Ensure this value is greater than or equal to %(limit_value)s."
msgstr "Dieser Wert muss grösser oder gleich %(limit_value)s sein."

#. Overrides Django's German texts for the fields of PermissionsMixin, so that the user form
#. uses the project's terms ("system administrator", "account"; D-012, D-036).
msgid "superuser status"
msgstr "Systemadministrator"

msgid "Designates that this user has all permissions without explicitly assigning them."
msgstr "Hat alle Berechtigungen, ohne dass sie einzeln zugewiesen werden."

msgid "The groups this user belongs to. A user will get all permissions granted to each of their groups."
msgstr "Die Gruppen, zu denen dieses Konto gehört. Das Konto erhält alle Berechtigungen dieser Gruppen."

msgid "Specific permissions for this user."
msgstr "Berechtigungen, die diesem Konto direkt zugewiesen sind."

